# [Cinematics](cinematics)

A real cutscene and a real rundown, authored the way a mission would author them -
so the format is exercised by a CONSUMER rather than only by unit tests, and so
`sbs lint` has something to validate.

`Subject:` names a **cast** the specimen binds before playing (`cutscene_cast`), which
is why the same file can be replayed against different ships without editing.

## [Chapter One](intro)
---
Letterbox: yes
Skippable: yes
Bar: 4
---

## [Establish the station](intro_1)
---
Cutscene: intro
Subject: station
Lens: 0, 1200, -5000
Seconds: 5
Overlay: lower_third
Name: Phoenix Control
---
All quiet on the belt. Third watch, nothing to report.

